OL,3,GNEWSARider critically injured after
OL,4,Aelectric motorbike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn electric motorbike rider has been
OL,7,Fcritically injured after a crash on a
OL,8,Ffootpath in Glasgow.
OL,10,FPolice were called to the collision
OL,11,Finvolving a Surron bike on Edinburgh
OL,12,FRoad, between Stepps Road and
OL,13,FSpringboig Road, at about 19:45 on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FThe 25-year-old male rider was taken to
OL,17,FQueen Elizabeth University Hospital for
OL,18,Ftreatment.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
